{"3514000":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Crazy Life","steam_appid":3514000,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5336470],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Overview<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Crazy Life<\/i> is a <strong>multiplayer, board-game-style life simulation<\/strong> that can be played by up to six players.       <br>       <br><strong><i>Rules<\/i><\/strong>       <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is turn-based, with one turn representing one in-game year.        <br>When the game ends, the player with the highest total assets wins.        <br>Players spin a roulette wheel to determine their movement and trigger different events depending on the space they land on.       <br>       <br><strong><i>Types of space<\/i> <\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>※<\/strong>This image is from the Japanese version, but the full English version will be available in the final release.<strong> <\/strong> <br><strong><i>Card acquisition space<\/i><\/strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/07bf355bd556dd9f3ec866b9a59150a7.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/07bf355bd556dd9f3ec866b9a59150a7.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/07bf355bd556dd9f3ec866b9a59150a7.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can obtain one random card out of 60 different types.<br>Using the cards you’ve collected allows you to gain advantages and change the flow of the game.<br><br><strong><i>Card purchase space<\/i><\/strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/ead907557bbba4d51b2dc122bee16034.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/ead907557bbba4d51b2dc122bee16034.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/ead907557bbba4d51b2dc122bee16034.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can purchase selected cards <br> <br><strong><i>money space<\/i> <\/strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/35d4ec9bf4b69be5f28739512b7832a6.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/35d4ec9bf4b69be5f28739512b7832a6.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/35d4ec9bf4b69be5f28739512b7832a6.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events can increase or decrease your money.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Job change space<\/i><\/strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/e06df12adb6a5c63c4672575086f7ab1.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/e06df12adb6a5c63c4672575086f7ab1.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/e06df12adb6a5c63c4672575086f7ab1.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can change jobs to a random occupation.<br>There is a chance that you will not be hired.<br><br><strong><i>Promotion Space<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/0d168050ce760368d2d959b526d1c567.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/0d168050ce760368d2d959b526d1c567.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/0d168050ce760368d2d959b526d1c567.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you already have a job, landing on this space increases your Job Level.<br>If you are unemployed, it has the same effect as a Card Space.<br><br><strong><i>salary Space<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/4529c72eeaffba4a04e2034e27b0aa8b.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/4529c72eeaffba4a04e2034e27b0aa8b.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/4529c72eeaffba4a04e2034e27b0aa8b.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You earn a salary based on your current job and job level<strong>.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you pass a Payday Space, a “Payday” is counted.   <br>At the end of your turn, all counted “Paydays” are consumed and your salary is paid.   <br>If you land exactly on a Payday Space, your salary is doubled.   <br>   <br><strong><i>Marriage space (Before Marriage)<\/i> <\/strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/08e38123f39618d7ee0f51fb190e0ddf.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/08e38123f39618d7ee0f51fb190e0ddf.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/08e38123f39618d7ee0f51fb190e0ddf.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get married by increasing your relationship level with a character you’ve exchanged contact information with.<br>Characters of higher rarity have <strong>unique abilities<\/strong> that can give you powerful advantages during the game.<br><br><strong><i>Marriage space (After Marriage)<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/3439c004415ebaee59a9d2e06385dc85.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/3439c004415ebaee59a9d2e06385dc85.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/3439c004415ebaee59a9d2e06385dc85.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After getting married, you can have children by landing on certain spaces.<br>You can also increase your child’s stats as they grow.<br>Children take action once every three years — they can earn money or even bring you new cards!<br><br><strong><i>Worst space<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/16819023166e4b84f0b42879693edef2.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/16819023166e4b84f0b42879693edef2.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/16819023166e4b84f0b42879693edef2.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may have to pay a huge fine, lose your job, or even see your properties burn down.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Overview<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Crazy Life<\/i> is a <strong>multiplayer, board-game-style life simulation<\/strong> that can be played by up to six players.       <br>       <br><strong><i>Rules<\/i><\/strong>       <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is turn-based, with one turn representing one in-game year.        <br>When the game ends, the player with the highest total assets wins.        <br>Players spin a roulette wheel to determine their movement and trigger different events depending on the space they land on.       <br>       <br><strong><i>Types of space<\/i> <\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>※<\/strong>This image is from the Japanese version, but the full English version will be available in the final release.<strong> <\/strong> <br><strong><i>Card acquisition space<\/i><\/strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/07bf355bd556dd9f3ec866b9a59150a7.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/07bf355bd556dd9f3ec866b9a59150a7.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/07bf355bd556dd9f3ec866b9a59150a7.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can obtain one random card out of 60 different types.<br>Using the cards you’ve collected allows you to gain advantages and change the flow of the game.<br><br><strong><i>Card purchase space<\/i><\/strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/ead907557bbba4d51b2dc122bee16034.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/ead907557bbba4d51b2dc122bee16034.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/ead907557bbba4d51b2dc122bee16034.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can purchase selected cards <br> <br><strong><i>money space<\/i> <\/strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/35d4ec9bf4b69be5f28739512b7832a6.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/35d4ec9bf4b69be5f28739512b7832a6.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/35d4ec9bf4b69be5f28739512b7832a6.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events can increase or decrease your money.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Job change space<\/i><\/strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/e06df12adb6a5c63c4672575086f7ab1.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/e06df12adb6a5c63c4672575086f7ab1.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/e06df12adb6a5c63c4672575086f7ab1.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can change jobs to a random occupation.<br>There is a chance that you will not be hired.<br><br><strong><i>Promotion Space<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/0d168050ce760368d2d959b526d1c567.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/0d168050ce760368d2d959b526d1c567.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/0d168050ce760368d2d959b526d1c567.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you already have a job, landing on this space increases your Job Level.<br>If you are unemployed, it has the same effect as a Card Space.<br><br><strong><i>salary Space<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/4529c72eeaffba4a04e2034e27b0aa8b.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/4529c72eeaffba4a04e2034e27b0aa8b.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/4529c72eeaffba4a04e2034e27b0aa8b.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You earn a salary based on your current job and job level<strong>.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you pass a Payday Space, a “Payday” is counted.   <br>At the end of your turn, all counted “Paydays” are consumed and your salary is paid.   <br>If you land exactly on a Payday Space, your salary is doubled.   <br>   <br><strong><i>Marriage space (Before Marriage)<\/i> <\/strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/08e38123f39618d7ee0f51fb190e0ddf.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/08e38123f39618d7ee0f51fb190e0ddf.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/08e38123f39618d7ee0f51fb190e0ddf.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get married by increasing your relationship level with a character you’ve exchanged contact information with.<br>Characters of higher rarity have <strong>unique abilities<\/strong> that can give you powerful advantages during the game.<br><br><strong><i>Marriage space (After Marriage)<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/3439c004415ebaee59a9d2e06385dc85.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/3439c004415ebaee59a9d2e06385dc85.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/3439c004415ebaee59a9d2e06385dc85.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After getting married, you can have children by landing on certain spaces.<br>You can also increase your child’s stats as they grow.<br>Children take action once every three years — they can earn money or even bring you new cards!<br><br><strong><i>Worst space<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/16819023166e4b84f0b42879693edef2.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/16819023166e4b84f0b42879693edef2.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/16819023166e4b84f0b42879693edef2.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may have to pay a huge fine, lose your job, or even see your properties burn down.<\/p>","short_description":"A life simulation game for up to 6 online players.Become a resident of Shishizaka City and aim to become the richest by getting jobs, changing careers, buying properties, getting married, raising children, and using cards.Experience a turbulent life in a vast city!","supported_languages":"Japanese, English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/33949c304a802a7c22ea2a76a2168faab21df8cf\/header.jpg?t=1792629269","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/ee716d4172905ebc0649de8db8a6dde1e4e97b96\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792629269","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/ee716d4172905ebc0649de8db8a6dde1e4e97b96\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792629269","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 14 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any<br><\/li><li><strong>VR Support:<\/strong> None<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"ext_user_account_notice":"Epic Online Services (Supports Linking to Steam Account)"}}}